{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/462x174.png?t=1749516280\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for chaos! In <strong>Silent Survivor</strong>, you control unique heroes fighting off relentless hordes in intense survival arenas. Your goal? <strong>Last as long as possible</strong> \u2014 and that takes more than brute strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources, upgrade your skills, strategize, and <strong>evolve in real time</strong> as the danger ramps up every second. Manage your upgrades wisely \u2014 every decision could be the difference between survival and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 A variety of heroes with distinct playstyles<br>\ud83d\udd39 Ever-growing and challenging enemies<br>\ud83d\udd39 Dynamic progression system based on resource collection<br>\ud83d\udd39 Fast-paced combat focused on survival and strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How long can you last before the horde overwhelms you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/extras/SilentSurvivorTrailer1080p-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1749516280\" />\u00a0 \u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758590?t=1749516280","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758590?t=1749516280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/5ef24c28fd77ef39f1a1790720551b30a2623b8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749516280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758590/5ef24c28fd77ef39f1a1790720551b30a2623b8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749516280","cat